  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to continued crisis and conflict - and to not forego gains already made - an extension of the RSF is proposed for the period of September 2024 to August 2028. The extended phase of the current RSF wil focus on strengthening and increasing stabilization support, with a particular emphasis on governmen1: ownership for sustained impacts. Stabilization has proven to be a highly relevant model in the LCB context: offering a unique value addition that complements regional, national and local ini</narrative>
